oduct__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Nova Post  branch delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post  parcel locker delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post courier delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://betrendy.space/oplata-i-dostavka/\">More about delivery</a></p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"payment-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Payment to the current account:</p>\n<p>Beneficiary: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED] Mariia Borysivna</p>\n<p>IBAN: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Online payment via Plata by mono</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"guarantee-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>12-month manufacturer's warranty.</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745a28cb3c\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Perfumed Shower Mousse </strong><strong data-end=\"60\" data-start=\"0\">«Cotton &amp; Mangosteen»</strong><strong> </strong><br/>\r\nWith cotton and mangosteen extracts.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/cotton-mangosteen-04.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/cotton-mangosteen-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/><br/>\r\nLight and gentle shower mousse features an <strong>incredible consistency </strong>and an advanced formula for delicate skin cleansing. Its weightless texture envelops the body in clouds of softness, delivering unforgettable hydration. Immerse yourself in gentle indulgence with Be Trendy products.</p>\n<p><strong>Cotton Extract.</strong> A valuable ingredient for the skin, delivering effective nourishing, hydrating, softening, and restoring benefits to the upper layers of the skin. It perfectly helps combat common issues like dryness, flaking, and tightness, while slowing down the aging process of the skin.<br/>\n<strong>Mangosteen Extract. </strong>The active components of mangosteen extract cleanse the skin and help regulate sebum production. Rich in natural moisturizing factors, it provides gentle exfoliation. It delivers exfoliating, brightening, and hydrating benefits, restoring skin tone and firmness while enhancing your complexion.<br/>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-04(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/cotton-mangosteen-05.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>This <strong>shower mousse features an enchanting niche fragrance. </strong>It opens with airy, near-weightless <strong>citrus notes</strong> hidden within subtle powdery depths. The fragrance then transitions into delicate <strong>notes of jasmine and orchid </strong>with creamy finish. Finally, <strong>a long, sensual trail wraps </strong>you in the woody accords of exotic plants, the pristine aroma of raw amber, and the velvety softness of musk.</p>\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4mPNYH49MAo\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/4mPNYH49MAo</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid4221b7292edb8885553b6917fad005b8\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid4221b7292edb8885553b6917fad005b8\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"fc92c29fc6e1290ac9d3ca7a56c07f3c\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"f26aa4675817ba63a8655820d61fa4e0\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_2\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"0a8224eb992580b3dacdd16a2c66510a\" style=\"position